{"id":"09268699702789db","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-thm-mice.md","title":"Mice","display":"thm-mice — Mice","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-mice","aliases":["58-thm-mice","Mice","Mouse Theory"],"display":"thm-mice — Mice","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-model7-iterable-premouse]]","[[58-df-zfc-inner-sound-premouse]]","[[58-df-zfc-inner4-comparison-process]]","[[58-df-equinumerous]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-mice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-mice</span><span>Mice</span><span>Mouse Theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-mice — Mice"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3ea3dede2645310a\" href=\"?note=3ea3dede2645310a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-model7-iterable-premouse\">58-df-zfc-model7-iterable-premouse</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e2c90c7f1f68c14\" href=\"?note=3e2c90c7f1f68c14\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner-sound-premouse\">58-df-zfc-inner-sound-premouse</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f09541c13d757646\" href=\"?note=f09541c13d757646\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner4-comparison-process\">58-df-zfc-inner4-comparison-process</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"58-df-equinumerous\">58-df-equinumerous</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,L_M,L_N,\\rho_M,p_M,\\rho_N,p_N,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U,\\ell,\\operatorname{Last},\\mathcal B,\\unlhd\\in V\">\\(M,N,L_M,L_N,\\rho_M,p_M,\\rho_N,p_N,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U,\\ell,\\operatorname{Last},\\mathcal B,\\unlhd\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterablePremouse}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterablePremouse}_S\\)</span> (iterable-premouse predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S\\)</span> (sound-premouse predicate with explicit projectum and parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ComparisonProcess}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ComparisonProcess}_S\\)</span> (successful comparison witness)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S\\)</span> (equinumerosity predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mice}\\vdash\\forall M,N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(M,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(N,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterablePremouse}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterablePremouse}_S(N)\\land\\bigl(\\exists L_M,\\rho_M,p_M\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S(M,L_M,\\rho_M,p_M)\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(\\exists L_N,\\rho_N,p_N\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S(N,L_N,\\rho_N,p_N)\\bigr)\\to\\exists\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U,\\ell,\\operatorname{Last},\\mathcal B,\\unlhd\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ComparisonProcess}_S(M,N,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U,\\ell,\\operatorname{Last},\\mathcal B,\\unlhd)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mice}\\vdash\\forall M,N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(M,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(N,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterablePremouse}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterablePremouse}_S(N)\\land\\bigl(\\exists L_M,\\rho_M,p_M\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S(M,L_M,\\rho_M,p_M)\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(\\exists L_N,\\rho_N,p_N\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S(N,L_N,\\rho_N,p_N)\\bigr)\\to\\exists\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U,\\ell,\\operatorname{Last},\\mathcal B,\\unlhd\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ComparisonProcess}_S(M,N,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U,\\ell,\\operatorname{Last},\\mathcal B,\\unlhd)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jensen, Dodd, Steel: developed mouse theory.</li>\n<li>A mouse is an iterable premouse satisfying the relevant soundness and smallness conditions.</li>\n<li>The soundness hypotheses include their premouse-language parameters, and the comparison conclusion exposes all eight arguments of the registered witness predicate.</li>\n<li>Comparison places the two last models of the iteration trees in a common initial-segment order.</li>\n<li>Premice are the preliminary structures before full iterability is verified.</li>\n<li>Core model: built from mice.</li>\n<li>Foundation: for inner models beyond <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L[U]\">\\(L[U]\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-model7-iterable-premouse","status":"resolved","id":"3ea3dede2645310a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-model7-iterable-premouse]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-inner-sound-premouse","status":"resolved","id":"3e2c90c7f1f68c14","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-inner-sound-premouse]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-inner4-comparison-process","status":"resolved","id":"f09541c13d757646","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-inner4-comparison-process]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equinumerous","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[5